      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PF Session Follow-up\nInput: `{ invitee_uri, mode }`. One run per session.\n\n1. Checks the row is `active` and the host passes the mock guard.\n2. DMs the host through **Slack Bot**: did the participant join? Waits until the session end.\n3. No answer: one reminder (mock 3 min, real 24 h), then `unanswered`.\n4. Yes: `showed_up`, wait until the end, then reward (step 6).\n5. No: `no_show`, then the rebook email (step 5).",
        "color": 5
      }
    },
